OL,3,GNEWSATwo 18-year-olds injured in park  
OL,4,Astabbing                               
OL,6,FTwo men have been stabbed in a Greater 
OL,7,FManchester park, with police still yet 
OL,8,Fto make any arrests.                   
OL,10,FThe 18-year-olds were found injured at 
OL,11,Fthe entrance of Alexandra Park in      
OL,12,FOldham after police were called shortly
OL,13,Fbefore 17:00 GMT on Saturday.          
OL,15,FThe pair were treated for stab injuries
OL,16,Fand taken to hospital. Their conditions
OL,17,Fwere not believed to be                
OL,18,Flife-threatening.                      
